      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "括7的质因数：",
        "$10=2\\cdot5$，$100=2\\cdot2\\cdot5\\cdot5$，",
        "$1000=2\\cdot2\\cdot2\\cdot5\\cdot5\\cdot5$等等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分数$\\frac{12}{15}$的分母的质因数分解中包括质因数3. 尽管这样，",
        "还是可以把这个分数化成有限小数. 因为约分之后得分数",
        "$\\frac{4}{5}$，它的分母已经不包括2和5以外的质因数：",
        "$\\frac{12}{15}=\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{8}{10}=0.8$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果一个分数的分母的质因数中只含有2和5，那么这个",
        "分数就可以写成有限小数. 如果一个分数是既约分数，而且它",
        "的分母的质因数中除2和5以外还有其它质因数，那么就不",
        "能把这个分数写成有限小数的形式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分数化成的无限小数可按照有限小数的比较规则比较它",
        "们的大小. 例如：",
        "$0.666\\ldots>0.665\\ldots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1108",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1108. 下列分数中哪些能够写成有限小数的形式，哪些不能？",
        "$\\frac{33}{80}$，$\\frac{7}{75}$，$\\frac{27}{50}$，$\\frac{5}{48}$，$\\frac{27}{28}$，$\\frac{17}{25}$，$\\frac{3}{6}$，$\\frac{15}{12}$，",
        "$\\frac{13}{12}$，$\\frac{7}{28}$，$\\frac{8}{28}$，$\\frac{9}{75}$，$\\frac{25}{75}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1109",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1109. 把下列各数写成小数的形式：",
        "$\\frac{5}{16}$，$\\frac{146}{125}$，$45\\frac{73}{80}$，$26\\frac{27}{32}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1110",
      "box": null,
